  "question": {
    "text": "A water sample has ppm level concentration of the following metals:<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.2</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Mn</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.0</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Zn</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.0</mo></math> .<br /><br />The metal that makes the water sample unsuitable for drinking is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
